WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Shortlist helps you compare supplier quotes and choose one that

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.200
meets your budget and deadline. These three quotes are fictional.

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:10.534
Click a price to see the exact words it came

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:10.802
from.

00:00:11.452 --> 00:00:14.981
Cedar confirms a delay. I correct the date and lock

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:17.452
it, so Harbor becomes the suitable choice.

00:00:18.102 --> 00:00:21.661
Now Cedar sends a new quote. A real agent reads

00:00:21.661 --> 00:00:25.220
it and saves the new price and shipping. My locked

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:28.779
date stays. The updated facts appear in the comparison, and

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:30.558
Shortlist verifies the saved change.

00:00:37.395 --> 00:00:41.400
Reloading keeps the correction. Lowering the budget to five
hundred

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.803
ninety dollars leaves no suitable offer.

00:00:44.453 --> 00:00:48.922
Undo restores the earlier budget. Export downloads the decision
and

00:00:48.922 --> 00:00:53.390
its original quote evidence. This recording shows the actual
working

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:53.837
application.
